OL,3,AHusband who drugged and raped wife for
OL,4,A20 years makes witness statement
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who has admitted drugging and
OL,7,Fraping his wife without her knowledge
OL,8,Ffor more than 20 years has provided a
OL,9,Fwitness statement about "what he says
OL,10,Fhappened", a jury was told.
OL,12,FThe husband, who cannot be named to
OL,13,Fprotect his wife's right to anonymity,
OL,14,Fhad also been accused of inviting 13
OL,15,Fother men to abuse her from 2018 until
OL,16,FNovember 2025.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
