OL,3,AHusband who drugged and raped wife for
OL,4,A20 years makes witness statement
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man, in his 60s and from the
OL,7,FStockport area of Greater Manchester,
OL,8,Fhad initially denied the charges but
OL,9,Fpleaded guilty last month to 60
OL,10,Foffences, including rape and
OL,11,Fadministering a substance with intent.
OL,13,FA jury was sworn in at Manchester
OL,14,FMinshull Street Crown Court in early
OL,15,FSeptember but the case has since been
OL,16,Fdelayed for legal and practical
OL,17,Freasons.
